{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "aqdi-admin-message-alerts-api",
        "name": "AQDI Admin — Message Alerts API",
        "description": "Explanatory messages for **client** and **employee** dashboards.\n\n**Audience paths**\n- Client: `/api/admin/message-alerts/client/...`\n- Employee: `/api/admin/message-alerts/employee/...`\n\n**Add message modal (إضافة رسالة جديدة)**\n1. `GET .../message-alerts/{client|employee}/create` — sections + items\n2. Or: sections dropdown → `GET .../message-alert-sections/{audience}/options/list`\n3. Items dropdown → `GET .../message-alert-section-items/{audience}/options/list?message_alert_section_id=`\n4. `POST .../message-alerts/{client|employee}` — body below\n\n**Aliases accepted:** `section_id`, `section_item_id`, `text`",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "http://localhost:8000"
        },
        {
            "key": "message_alert_section_id",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "message_alert_section_item_id",
            "value": "1"
        },
        {
            "key": "message_alert_id",
            "value": "1"
        }
    ],
